{"id":"npc:%E7%A2%8E%E9%AA%A8","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"本名亚历克斯，乌萨斯人，整合运动干部，米莎的弟弟。使用乌萨斯皇帝内卫的装备。为救回米莎而和W一同带队进攻龙门。因试图突袭博士而激怒了阿米娅，被阿米娅的精神爆发攻击命中而死。","spoiler":true,"source":"主线剧情2-5 高空坠物、3-4 龟裂、3-8 黄昏等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_char_1500_skulsr.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/8/8f/Avg_char_1500_skulsr.png/240px-Avg_char_1500_skulsr.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-05_beg","lineCount":4,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":95,"line":96,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"——"},{"commandIndex":96,"line":97,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"终于……"},{"commandIndex":102,"line":103,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"我终于……找到你了。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-05_end","lineCount":5,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":30,"line":31,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":37,"line":38,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"……但我找到她了——不，不……"},{"commandIndex":38,"line":39,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"我是……等到她……"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-09_beg","lineCount":6,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":43,"line":44,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":46,"line":47,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"你们，把她交给龙门了？"},{"commandIndex":60,"line":61,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"我的同胞，动手吧！"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-09_end","lineCount":2,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":44,"line":45,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"继续给我追。"},{"commandIndex":45,"line":46,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"别让他们有任何喘息的机会。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-10_beg","lineCount":10,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":41,"line":42,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"————"},{"commandIndex":83,"line":84,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"多少同胞的性命，你们都得血债血偿！"},{"commandIndex":86,"line":87,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"给我进攻！"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_02-10_end","lineCount":8,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":5,"line":6,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"唔……"},{"commandIndex":12,"line":13,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"嘁，这帮家伙确实很棘手！"},{"commandIndex":39,"line":40,"speaker":"碎骨","text":"下次见面就是死期了。"}]},{"story":"obt/main/level_main_03-02_end","lineCount":59,